# AUTORESEARCH run artifacts are regenerable session scratch. Keep the tree
# clean: ignore heartbeats, sentinels, logs, pointers, and per-run output.
# The evidence files that BACK A FIXTURE BASELINE are force-added explicitly
# in the commit that bakes the hash (git add -f), so provenance stays auditable
# without dragging session scratch into history.
runs/**/state.json
runs/**/DONE
runs/**/FAILED
runs/**/ABANDONED
runs/**/run.out.log
runs/**/run.err.log
runs/**/raw_model_output.json
runs/LATEST.txt
runs/_*.txt

# Proposed missions are scout drafts; they become real only when you run them.
# Ignored by default - promote a keeper by force-adding it.
missions/proposed/
